%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0e0fa3f95b7236c4bbd27e79693b209f, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialCopy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialCopySO
  lines:
  - Step: 1
    Text: 'Welcome, Commander!

      Enemy waves march down <b>your</b> lane. Stop
      them before they reach your base.'
  - Step: 2
    Text: 'This is your <b>Mana</b>. It fills on its own, and every card costs some.

      Spend
      it wisely.'
  - Step: 3
    Text: 'These are the cards in your hand.

      Play one and the next is dealt
      straight away.'
  - Step: 4
    Text: Drag the <b>tower card</b> onto the highlighted slot to build your defence.
  - Step: 5
    Text: 'Drop that <b>same tower card</b> on the tower again to <b>level it up</b>.

      Stronger,
      and it costs you no new slot.'
  - Step: 6
    Text: <b>Swipe down</b> to look at your opponent's lane.
  - Step: 7
    Text: Attack! Drop a <b>troop card</b> on their lane to send fighters at them.
  - Step: 8
    Text: Drop <b>Rage</b> right on your fighters to send them charging up their lane.
  - Step: 9
    Text: <b>Swipe back up</b> to defend your own base.
  - Step: 10
    Text: 'That is everything you need!

      Now finish the match: clear all <b>{0}
      waves</b> to win.'
  - Step: 11
    Text: 'This is your base camp.

      Your new card is waiting in your collection.'
  - Step: 12
    Text: Open the <b>Deck</b> page.
  - Step: 13
    Text: Your deck is full. Tap a card that is in it and choose <b>Remove</b> to
      make room.
  - Step: 14
    Text: Now tap your <b>new card</b> and choose <b>Use</b> to put it in the deck.
  - Step: 15
    Text: Tap it once more and hit <b>Details</b> to see exactly what it does.
  - Step: 16
    Text: Spend your copies and gold on <b>Upgrade</b> to make it stronger for good.
  - Step: 17
    Text: Nicely done. Head back to the <b>main</b> page.
  - Step: 18
    Text: 'You are ready.

      Hit <b>BATTLE</b> to search for your first real match!'
  - Step: 19
    Text: Stronger already. <b>Close</b> the card details when you are done looking.
  - Step: 20
    Text: 'Your fighters march their lane <b>backwards</b>, against the waves attacking
      them.

      Your opponent can send troops at you the same way - they arrive from the <b>other
      end</b> of your lane.'
  - Step: 21
    Text: 'Enemies in your lane! Drop <b>Fireball</b> right on top of them.

      That
      is the <b>defensive</b> kind - it only ever works on your own side.'
  - Step: 22
    Text: 'Spells come in two kinds: <b>offensive</b> ones for their field, <b>defensive</b>
      ones for yours.

      <b>Rage</b> is offensive - it drives your troops forward
      much faster.'
  - Step: 23
    Text: Enemies are close to your base! Drop <b>Fireball</b> right on them.
  - Step: 24
    Text: Mana to spare! Build another <b>tower</b>, or drop the same card on one to level
      it up.
